# Graphify — query first, low token

`graphify-out/graph.json` already exists. For architecture, call-graph, or "how does X work" questions, run:

```bash
graphify query "<question>" --budget 1500
```

Do not run the full Graphify pipeline, `--mode deep`, semantic subagents, HTML/Obsidian/wiki exports, or video transcription unless the user explicitly asks.

Do not run `graphify update` after every edit — the post-commit hook refreshes AST. If a refresh is explicitly requested:

```bash
graphify update . --no-viz --no-label
```

